Subject: [PATCH 15/61] ARM: dts: r8a7745: Add USB-DMAC device nodes
Date: Wed,  6 Dec 2017 11:22:10 +0100
Message-Id: <fbdf17b307dae407b2e673806386f84660d01b63.1512555546.git.horms+renesas@verge.net.au>
